{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13635","headline":"剡中赠张卿侍御 · 严维","name":"剡中赠张卿侍御","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"辟疆年正少，公子贵初还。\n早列月卿位，新参柱史班。\n千夫驰驿道，驷马入家山。\n深巷乌衣盛，高门画戟闲。\n逶迤天乐下，照耀剡溪间。\n自贱游章句，空爲衰草颜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"严维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13635.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13635","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}